<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-shyer-intestinal-villi-buckling-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Hannezo et al. (2011) PRL & Shyer et al. (2013) Science sequential smooth-muscle mucosal buckling into ridges, zigzags, and hexagonal villi — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Links module docstrings to Shyer et al. (2013) Science, Hannezo et al. (2011) PRL, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_063_epithelial_buckling_crypt_villus.lean` (L1-21), but lacks trace links for Föppl-von Kármán energy minimization and FK506 smooth-muscle ablation experiments." ;
